  "data": {
    "summary": "Before the battle, during [Muster Armies](vsdata:core-rule/muster-armies), each **LEADER** unit may pick one friendly **BODYGUARD** unit [it can lead](vsdata:core-rule/forming-attached-units). The units form an [Attached unit](vsdata:core-rule/attached-units) for the battle. Each **BODYGUARD** unit can have up to one **LEADER** and up to one **SUPPORT** unit attached, unless a rule changes that limit.",
